
>> Rectangle := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.

Rectangle ଯେବେ: ['area'] କର: { <- ନିଜର ଲମ୍ବ * ନିଜର width.
}.

Rectangle ଯେବେ: ['length:'] କର: { :ଲମ୍ବ
	ନିଜର ଲମ୍ବ := ଲମ୍ବ.
}.

Rectangle ଯେବେ: ['width:'] କର: { :width
	ନିଜର width := width.
}.

Rectangle ଯେବେ: ['ନୂତନ'] କର: {
	# this will not result into an infinite loop
	>> rectangle := ନିଜେ ନୂତନ.
	rectangle length: 0, width: 0. <- rectangle.
}.

>> a := Rectangle ନୂତନ.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: a area, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି. #0

>> b := Rectangle ନୂତନ length: 2, width: 3.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: b area, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି. #6

